					"path": "billing",
					"op": "billing",
					"value": {
						"meters": {
							"input_audio_tokens": 2480
						}
					},
					"source": {
						"kind": "assumed",
						"reason": "OpenAI reports usage.type = duration, seconds = 62 (https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/audio/json-object). The catalogue prices whisper-1 on input_audio_tokens and the gateway converts at 40 tokens per second (providers/openai/endpoints/audio-transcription-usage.ts), so the authoritative quantity is 62 x 40 = 2,480, not the 20 s file-size estimate."
					}
				}
			]
		},
